{
  "name" : "Frascoli2014 - A dynamical model of tumour immunotherapy",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a coupled ordinary differential equation model of tumour-immune dynamics, accounting for biological and clinical factors which regulate the interaction rates of cytotoxic T lymphocytes on the surface of the tumour mass.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
